@startuml
actor Lecturer
participant "Unified shell" as Web
participant "Workspace API" as API
participant "Document access" as Access
database PostgreSQL as DB

Lecturer -> Web: Open Library
Web -> API: GET /workspace/library
API -> DB: current document versions
loop candidate
  API -> Access: require_version
  Access -> DB: verify tenant and scope
end
API --> Web: authorised version cards
Lecturer -> Web: Attach to conversation
Web -> Web: Add immutable version ID to composer
Lecturer -> Web: Send request
Web -> API: message + attachment_version_ids
API -> Access: re-authorise attached version
API --> Web: AI response using permitted context
@enduml
